					Slight life steal.
					'''
			}

			SpinyTurtleBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Spiny Turtle Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Reflects double the damage when attached. 
					Inherently Smart!
					'''
			}

			SpookyBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Spooky Battlerod
				Tooltip: Shoots bats
			}

			TerraBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Terra Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					The Legendary Rod. 
					Shoots blades when idle.
					'''
			}

			TurtleBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Turtle Battlerod
				Tooltip: Reflects all damage when attached
			}

			BeeBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Bee Battlerod
				Tooltip: So many Bees!
			}

			CactusBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Cactus Battlerod
				Tooltip: Prickly!
			}

			CoolerBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Cooler Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Allows 3 different powered baits at once.
					Does (almost) no damage.
					'''
			}

			CorruptBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Corrupt Battlerod
				Tooltip: Very slight mana syphon
			}

			CrimsonBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Crimson Battlerod
				Tooltip: Very slight life steal
			}

			DeerclopsBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Deerclops Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Creates two shadows
					Allows 2 different powered baits at once
					'''
			}

			DungeonBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Dungeon Battlerod
				Tooltip: I feel like I'm being wached...
			}

			GoldBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Gold Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Not a Golden Fishing Rod...
					I can hear the money raining down!
					'''
			}

			HellstoneBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Hellstone Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Sets enemies on fire!
					Can fish in lava
					'''
			}

			JungleBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Jungle Battlerod
				Tooltip: Poison enemies
			}

			MeteorBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Meteor Battlerod
				Tooltip: Sets enemies on fire!
			}

			SilverBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Silver Battlerod
				Tooltip: Really effective against werewolves
			}

			StarMixBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Star Mix Battlerod
				Tooltip: Doubles the damage against bosses
			}

			FractaliteBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Fractalite Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Creates an area where it infilcts enemies with the Solar Fire debuff
					Really strong!
					Fires homing bullets
					'''
			}

			NebulaBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Nebula Battlerod
				Tooltip: Releases helpfull pickups when wet
			}

			PowerGuardBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Power Guard Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Reflects triple the damage when attached
					Inherently Smart!
					Releases blazing, exploding beetles
					'''
			}

			RegalSistersBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Regal Sisters Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Homing Projectiles galore!
					Really good at fishing!
					'''
			}

			RodContainmentUnit: {
				DisplayName: Rod Containment Unit
				Tooltip:
					'''
					The Ultimate Battle Rod!
					Creates a large area around the bobber that damages whoever is inside
					'''
			}

			SolarBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Solar Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Creates an area where it infilcts enemies with the Solar Fire debuff
					Really strong!
					Can fish in lava
					'''
			}

			StardustBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Stardust Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Creates two Stardust Cell minions on swing
					Really good at fishing!
					'''
			}

			VortexBattlerod: {
				DisplayName: Vortex Battlerod
				Tooltip:
					'''
					Fires homing bullets
					Really Fast!
					'''
			}

			BeerPack: {
				DisplayName: Pack of Beer
				Tooltip: Not so cold anymore
			}

			IceCreamer: {
				DisplayName: Ice Creamer
				Tooltip: Shoots one of four different flavors!
			}

			MagicSoda: {
				DisplayName: Magic Soda
				Tooltip: Shake and Spray! Damage usually decreases with distance.
			}

			Melonbrand: {
				DisplayName: Melonbrand
				Tooltip: Throws melon slices on swing
			}
		}

