					Tooltip:
						'''
						Killing lava slimes leaves no lava in Expert or Master mode.
						In GFB worlds, killed hell bats and lava bats also leave no lava.
						'''
				}

				OnlyHostByPassword.Tooltip:
					'''
					Does nothing in singleplayer mode, reloading is required. After enabled, only the verified player(s) can change the mod configs
					While starting the server, a random 8-digit password will be sent in the server console. The server console can query the password by typing qotpassword.
					Players can type /qotpassword <password> to verify themselves. If the password is correct, the player will be able to change mod configs
					Effective to servers with port forwarding, as the IP verification does not work
					'''
			}

