					Wall Rod
					Unlimited Grand Design
					Ultimate Liquid Manipulator
					All now have unlimited range.
					Bucket mode now uses box placement when smart-cursor is disabled
					Tile mode can place grass (on dirt/mud), moss (on stone),
					hive (need hive), bone blocks (need bones/unlimited bones),
					living wood/leaf (need wood), living mahogany wood/leaf (need rich mahogany).
