			quick_sell: Transfers all items from the player's inventory that aren't favorited or in the hotbar to the sell grid
			checkbox_filter_and_tip: Entries must match every filter instead of just one
			checkbox_filter_not_tip: Flip filters to be exclusive
			buy_tooltip: The amount to purchase
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line6: &condition
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line5: $npcname
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line4: %modnpc
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line3: "#tooltip"
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line2: @moditem
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line1: itemname
			tooltippanel_item_searchbox_line0: Separate search criteria with '_'
			refresh_tip: Refresh market
			market_settings: Settings
			checkbox_dupe_tip: Removes all duplicate items from the market and keeps the cheapest entry
			checkbox_npc_con_tip: Shows items from npcs whose conditions haven't been met yet. (homeless, not spawned, etc..)
			checkbox_item_con_tip: Shows items whose sell conditions have not yet been met
			button_sell_items_tip: Refund is determined by your least happy NPC
			checkbox_and_mode_tip: Switches item search so all criteria in the search box must be met instead of just one
			tooltippanel_sort_tip: Sort items by
			checkbox_shift_sell_tip: When the shop market is visible, shift clicking items in your inventory automatically moves them to selling grid
			checkbox_sell_close_tip: Automatically sells items in the sell grid when closing the market
			checkbox_inv_close_tip: Automatically closes the shop market when closing the player inventory
		}
	}

